### Smoke tests técnicos — não substitui a homologação pela aplicação

@baseUrl = https://sandbox.openfinance.celcoin.dev
@token = {{CELCOIN_ACCESS_TOKEN}}
@account = {{CELCOIN_TEST_ACCOUNT}}
@clientRequestId = {{$random.uuid}}

### Saldo
GET {{baseUrl}}/baas/v2/wallet/balance?Account={{account}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Consulta de débitos veiculares
POST {{baseUrl}}/baas/v2/vehicledebts/consult
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "state": "{{VEHICLE_STATE}}",
  "licensePlate": "{{VEHICLE_PLATE}}",
  "renavam": "{{VEHICLE_RENAVAM}}",
  "documentNumber": "{{VEHICLE_DOCUMENT}}",
  "clientRequestId": "{{clientRequestId}}"
}

### TED — preencher somente com dados da massa autorizada
POST {{baseUrl}}/baas/v2/spb/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 0.01,
  "clientCode": "{{clientRequestId}}",
  "debitParty": { "account": "{{account}}" },
  "creditParty": {
    "bank": "{{TED_DESTINATION_ISPB}}",
    "account": "{{TED_DESTINATION_ACCOUNT}}",
    "branch": "{{TED_DESTINATION_BRANCH}}",
    "taxId": "{{TED_DESTINATION_DOCUMENT}}",
    "name": "{{TED_DESTINATION_NAME}}",
    "accountType": "CC",
    "personType": "F"
  },
  "clientFinality": "110"
}
